# mbsync (isync) — Gmail -> local Maildir
# Password read from macOS keychain (never stored in a file):
#   security add-generic-password -a cirnovskyv@gmail.com -s mbsync-gmail -w "$MUTT_PASS"

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User cirnovskyv@gmail.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a cirnovskyv@gmail.com -s mbsync-gmail -w"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/cert.pem
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
